  "cited_article_id": "configure-data-backup-and-compliance",
  "reply": "Only Administrators can change these settings. To configure backups and compliance archives: 1) Go to Settings > Security > Compliance, review the BAA text and click **Accept and Sign**. 2) Go to Settings > Data Management > Backups, toggle **Automated Daily Backups** on, choose the retention tier (90‑Day Standard or 1‑Year Extended), and click **Save Changes**. Backups run daily at midnight UTC and are kept for 90 days. Ensure you have signed the digital BAA before enabling any external cloud storage sync."
}
